Description: German and Spanish for the sentences the viewer's 3D menu keeps
 The twelve sentences the 3D menu keeps had Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, Japanese, Korean and Chinese
 (stereo-translations.patch); German and Spanish complete the edition's ten languages. The per-file entries are the stereo
 layer's own and come from its catalogues.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
---
